mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: linkedin-growth\ndescription: >-\n  The LinkedIn personal-profile growth playbook for 2026. Use when someone wants to \"grow on\n  LinkedIn,\" \"get more LinkedIn followers/reach,\" \"a LinkedIn strategy,\" \"how the LinkedIn algorithm\n  works,\" or how to use commenting/newsletters/video/connections to grow. Dwell time + early\n  meaningful comments are the engine, personal profiles massively out-reach company pages, links go\n  in the first comment, and strategic commenting on target accounts is the cheapest reach on the\n  platform. Uses the LADDER framework. Reads brand-profile + voice-builder first. The agent drafts\n  posts + comment copy and designs the system; a human does the live commenting/connecting/DMs;\n  WoopSocial schedules posts; metrics come from native LinkedIn analytics (SSI as a directional\n  check); nothing is fabricated. Single-post craft → linkedin-post-writer; company page →\n  linkedin-company-pages.\nversion: 1.0.0\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
